      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Farmersville%2C_California",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "In 1866, entrepreneurs John Crowley and Merrill Jasper opened a general store that later became the Brundage General Store after Brundage purchased it.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        24,
        27,
        28
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
