      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Farmersville%2C_California",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Every May, Farmersville hosts a Memorial Day Parade that attracts around 4,000 visitors from the surrounding area.",
